#. §0: `«{h1}»`
#: Game/Levels/FamUnion/L07eltwiseinter.lean:66
msgid "Again, work out the consequences of §0 first."
msgstr "和刚才一样，先看看从 §0 可以推出什么。"

#. §0: `∅`
#. §1: `A`
#: Game/Levels/FamUnion/L01proveexists.lean:62
msgid "Although §0 is a reasonable choice for a set that is a subset of §1, it is difficult\n"
"to complete the proof with this choice using only methods developed so far in this game.\n"
"Go back and try a different choice."
msgstr "选 §0 作为 §1 的子集很合理。不过，只用目前学过的方法，很难沿这条路完成证明。回到上一步，试试别的选择。"

#: Game/Levels/Inter/L01and.lean:11
msgid "And"
msgstr "且"

#: Game/Levels/FamInter/L02intersubinter.lean:27
msgid "As usual, if you're not sure how to proceed then writing\n"
"out definitions can help."
msgstr "和往常一样，如果一时看不出下一步，可以先试着展开定义。"

#. §0: `x`
#. §1: `h2`
#. §2: `intro x h2`
#: Game/Levels/Comp/L03compsub.lean:46
msgid "As usual, to prove a subset statement you need to introduce both a new object §0 and\n"
"a new assumption §1.  You can do it in one step with §2."
msgstr "和往常一样，要证明子集关系，需要引入一个新对象 §0 和一个新假设 §1。用 §2 一步就能引入两者。"

#. §0: `rewrite`
#. §1: `«{x}» ∈ ⋂₀ F`
#. §2: `mem_sInter`
#: Game/Levels/FamInter/L01intersub.lean:67
msgid "As usual, you may find it helpful to use the §0 tactic to write out the\n"
"definition of §1, using the theorem §2."
msgstr "和往常一样，可以用 §0 策略和定理 §2，把 §1 的定义展开。"

#. §0: `apply Subset.antisymm`
#. §1: `A ∩ B ⊆ B ∩ A`
#. §2: `B ∩ A ⊆ A ∩ B`
#. §3: `inter_subset_swap`
#: Game/Levels/Inter/L07inter_comm.lean:13
msgid "As we saw in Complement World, a good first step when your goal is an equation between\n"
"sets is §0.  For the theorem in this level, that will leave you with\n"
"two goals: §1 and §2.  Fortunately, you can prove *both* of these\n"
"goals by using the theorem §3 from the last level."
msgstr "我们在补集世界里见过，要证明两个集合相等，可以先用 §0。在这一关，这样做会得到两个目标，分别是 §1 和 §2。用上一关的定理 §3，*两个*目标都能证明。"

#. §0: `h2 «{h4}»`
#. §1: `exact h2 «{h4}»`
#: Game/Levels/Subset/L03have.lean:55
msgid "As we saw in the last level, §0 is now\n"
"a proof of the goal, so §1 will close the goal."
msgstr "和上一关一样，现在 §0 就是目标的一个证明，所以用 §1 就能完成目标。"

#. §0: `x : U`
#. §1: `A : Set U`
#. §2: `B : Set U`
#. §3: `mem_union x A B`
#. §4: `x ∈ A ∪ B ↔ x ∈ A ∨ x ∈ B`
#. §5: `rewrite [mem_union]`
#. §6: `x ∈ A ∪ B`
#. §7: `mem_inter_iff`
#. §8: `mem_union_iff`
#: Game/Levels/Union/L02subunion.lean:13
msgid "As with complements and intersections, one of the key tools for proving theorems about unions\n"
"is a theorem stating the definition.  If you have §0, §1, and §2,\n"
"then §3 is a proof of the statement §4.\n"
"That means you can use §5 to write out the definition of\n"
"§6 if it appears in any assumption or the goal.  (The similar theorem about intersections\n"
"was called §7.  Why isn't this one called §8?  I don't know.  The\n"
"naming of theorems in Lean is systematic, but there are occasional surprises.)"
msgstr "和补集、交集一样，证明并集的性质时，一个重要工具就是表述并集定义的定理。如果你有 §0、§1 和 §2，那么 §3 就是命题 §4 的证明。因此，只要假设或目标中出现 §6，你就可以用 §5 展开它的定义。（交集的对应定理叫作 §7。这一条为什么不叫 §8 呢？我也不知道。Lean 定理的命名有规律可循，不过偶尔也会出人意料。）"

#. §0: `h1`
#. §1: `«{h3}»`
#. §2: `x ∈ B`
#. §3: `have`
#: Game/Levels/Subset/L04imp.lean:65
msgid "As you saw in the previous level, you can now apply §0 to §1\n"
"to justify asserting §2, using the §3 tactic."
msgstr "和上一关一样，你现在可以把 §0 应用于 §1，作为 §2 的证明，用 §3 策略把这个结论加入假设。"

#. §0: `∅`
#. §1: `∅ ⊆ A`
#. §2: `Subset.refl`
#. §3: `A`
#: Game/Levels/FamUnion/L01proveexists.lean:71
msgid "By the way, another set that would have worked as a witness for the existential goal in this\n"
"theorem is the empty set, denoted §0.  However, to justify the use of that witness you would\n"
"have had to prove §1.  Since we already have the theorem §2, it was easier to use\n"
"§3 as the witness.\n"
"\n"
"Now that you know how to prove existential statements, you're ready to start working with\n"
"unions of families."
msgstr "顺便说一句，本定理的存在性目标还可以用空集（记作 §0）作为见证元。不过，要用这个见证元，就得证明 §1。既然已经有了定理 §2，选 §3 作为见证元就更省事。\n"
"\n"
"现在你已经知道怎样证明存在命题了，可以开始研究集族的并集了。"

