#. §0: $F$
#. §1: $(\\bigcup F)^c = \\bigcap \\{s \\mid s^c \\in F\\}$
#: Game/Levels/FamCombo/L01compunion.lean:25
#: Game/Levels/FamCombo/L02compinter.lean:19
msgid "For any family of sets §0, §1."
msgstr "对任意集族 §0，都有 §1。"

#. §0: `A`
#. §1: `B`
#. §2: `inter_subset_swap A B`
#. §3: `A ∩ B ⊆ B ∩ A`
#: Game/Levels/Inter/L06inter_sub_swap.lean:21
#: Game/Levels/Union/L04union_sub_swap.lean:22
msgid "For any sets §0 and §1, §2 is a proof of\n"
"§3."
msgstr "对任意集合 §0 和 §1，§2 都是 §3 的证明。"

#. §0: `A`
#. §1: `B`
#. §2: `inter_comm A B`
#. §3: `A ∩ B = B ∩ A`
#. §4: `Set.inter_comm`
#: Game/Levels/Inter/L07inter_comm.lean:23
#: Game/Levels/Union/L05union_comm.lean:21
#: Game/Levels/Combo/L01compunion.lean:23
#: Game/Levels/Combo/L02compint.lean:29
msgid "For any sets §0 and §1, §2 is a proof of the\n"
"statement §3.  In Mathlib, the name of this theorem is §4."
msgstr "对任意集合 §0 和 §1，§2 都是命题 §3 的一个证明。这个定理在 Mathlib 中名为 §4。"

