"assumption §2 is added to the list of assumptions, and in second, the new\n"
"assumption §3 is added.  Since §4 must be either true or false, these two cases cover\n"
"all possibilities."
msgstr "这一关要用到一种新的分情况证明方法。对任意命题 §0，策略 §1 都可以把证明分成两种情况。第一种情况下，会在假设列表中加入 §2；第二种情况下，则加入 §3。因为 §4 或真或假，这两种情况就涵盖了所有可能。"

#. §0: `compl_union`
#. §1: `compl_union`
#. §2: `push_neg`
#: Game/Levels/FamCombo/L01compunion.lean:14
msgid "In this level you'll prove a generalization of the theorem §0 that you proved\n"
