# lean-game: proof-example
#: Game/Levels/FamCombo/L02compinter.lean:61
msgid "You have proved De Morgan's law for the complement of a family intersection."
msgstr "你把交集的德摩根律推广到了任意集族。下面的证法中，等价命题的两边都要求某个集合存在。每个方向都先取出假设中的见证元 `s`，再用它的补集 `sᶜ` 作目标的见证元。\n"
"\n"
"```lean\n"
"ext x\n"
"rewrite [mem_compl_iff, mem_sInter, mem_sUnion]\n"
"push_neg\n"
"constructor\n"
"intro ⟨s, hs⟩\n"
"use sᶜ\n"
"rewrite [mem_setOf, compl_compl]\n"
"exact hs\n"
"intro ⟨s, hs⟩\n"
"use sᶜ\n"
"rewrite [mem_compl_iff]\n"
"push_neg\n"
"exact hs\n"
"```"

# lean-game: proof-example
#: Game/Levels/FamCombo/L01compunion.lean:80
msgid "You have proved De Morgan's law for the complement of a family union."
msgstr "你把并集的德摩根律推广到了任意集族。下面的证法先用 `push_neg` 把否定推到量词里面。两个方向都把假设用在当前集合的补集上。\n"
"\n"
"```lean\n"
"ext x\n"
"rewrite [mem_compl_iff, mem_sUnion, mem_sInter]\n"
"push_neg\n"
"constructor\n"
"intro h s hs\n"
"by_contra hn\n"
"exact h sᶜ hs hn\n"
"intro h s hs\n"
"apply h sᶜ\n"
"rewrite [mem_setOf, compl_compl]\n"
"exact hs\n"
"```"

# lean-game: proof-example
#: Game/Levels/Combo/L01compunion.lean:40
msgid "You have proved De Morgan's law for the complement of a union."
msgstr "你证明了并集的德摩根律。一种证法是先把集合相等化为关于元素的等价命题，再用 `push_neg` 处理否定。\n"
"\n"
"```lean\n"
"ext x\n"
"rewrite [mem_inter_iff]\n"
"rewrite [mem_compl_iff, mem_compl_iff, mem_compl_iff]\n"
"rewrite [mem_union]\n"
"push_neg\n"
"rfl\n"
"```"

# lean-game: proof-example
#: Game/Levels/Combo/L02compint.lean:41
msgid "You have proved De Morgan's law for the complement of an intersection."
