#: Game/Levels/Comp/L01contra.lean:41
msgid "§0 means \"it is not the case that §1\".  To enter the symbol §2,\n"
"type §3.\n"
"\n"
"### If your goal is §4\n"
"\n"
"You may be able to use the §5 tactic to reexpress the goal as an equivalent\n"
"positive statement.  If not, then a good strategy is to use proof by contradiction.  The\n"
"tactic §6 will introduce the assumption §7, and set the goal to be §8.\n"
"\n"
"### If you have an assumption §9\n"
"\n"
"You may be able to use the tactic §10 to reexpress this assumption as an equivalent\n"
"positive statement.  Lean treats §11 as meaning §12, so if you also have §13,\n"
"then §14 will be a proof of §15.  That means that if you are doing a proof by\n"
"contradiction, so your goal is §16, then §17 will close the goal."
msgstr "§0 表示「§1 不成立」。要输入符号 §2，请键入 §3。\n"
"\n"
"### 若目标是 §4\n"
"\n"
"可以试试 §5 策略，看能否把目标改写为等价的肯定命题。如果这条路走不通，可以用反证法。策略 §6 会引入假设 §7，并把 §8 设为目标。\n"
"\n"
"### 若有假设 §9\n"
"\n"
"可以试试 §10，看能否把这个假设改写为等价的肯定命题。对 Lean 来说，§11 就是 §12，因此，如果还有 §13，那么 §14 就是 §15 的一个证明。换句话说，如果你在用反证法，当前目标是 §16，那么 §17 就能完成目标。"

