#: Game/Levels/Comp/L02compdef.lean:43
msgid "§0 means \"§1 if and only if §2\".  You can enter the symbol §3 by typing §4.\n"
"\n"
"### If your goal is §5\n"
"\n"
"If §6 and §7 are definitionally equivalent, then §8 will close the goal.\n"
"If you have §9 and §10, then §11 is a proof of §12,\n"
"so §13 will close the goal.\n"
"If you don't yet have proofs of §14 and §15, then §16 will set §17\n"
"and §18 as your goals.  In this situation, the tactic §19 has the same effect as\n"
"§20.\n"
"\n"
"### If you have an assumption §21\n"
"\n"
"Lean will recognize §22 as a proof of §23 and §24 as a proof of §25.  You may\n"
"also find it helpful to use §26 in the §27 tactic."
msgstr "§0 表示「§1 当且仅当 §2」。输入 §4 可以打出符号 §3。\n"
"\n"
"### 若目标是 §5\n"
"\n"
"如果 §6 和 §7 定义等价，§8 就能完成目标。如果你有 §9 和 §10，那么 §11 就是 §12 的证明，因此 §13 能完成目标。如果你还没有 §14 和 §15 的证明，§16 可以把 §17 和 §18 设为两个待证目标。在这种情况下，策略 §19 和 §20 的效果相同。\n"
"\n"
"### 若有假设 §21\n"
"\n"
"Lean 会把 §22 识别为 §23 的证明，把 §24 识别为 §25 的证明。在 §27 策略中使用 §26 也可能会有帮助。"

